<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 589.71, up 0.94.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 277 to 257.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.02.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 16,870,740 compared with 20,900,230 on Friday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
